  m_text: "Type: 1-bedroom suite (980 sq ft)\L Location: Ollantaytambo \u2014 near
    Incan ruins and artisan markets\L Description: A serene suite designed with authentic
    Andean textiles and natural materials, featuring a cozy living area with a fireplace,
    a private balcony overlooking ancient terraces, and a luxurious bathroom with
    a rainfall shower. Perfect for those seeking cultural immersion with modern comfort.\L
    Amenities: High-speed Wi-Fi, cultural concierge for arranging local experiences,
    exclusive access to a rooftop meditation terrace.\L Extra perks: \u201CCultural
    Explorer\u201D package \u2014 private guided visits to lesser-known Incan sites
    and artisan workshops.\L Sample rate: from $650 / night Sample rate: from $650
    / nightSample rate: from $650 / night"
