  m_text: " Type: Designer loft (studio + mezzanine, 900 sq ft)\L Location: Cusco
    \u2014 city center with easy access to historical sites\L Description: Modern
    loft combining industrial design with traditional Incan motifs, featuring high
    ceilings, a mezzanine bedroom, an open kitchen, and views of the San Blas district.
    Ideal for travelers who want a vibrant urban base to explore the region.\L Amenities:
    Rooftop lounge with panoramic city views, bike rentals, daily breakfast delivered
    to the suite.\L Extra perks: Invitation to local cultural events and artisan
    markets.\L Sample rate: from $480 / night"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
