  m_text: "Type: 2-bedroom penthouse (1,615 sq ft + 375 sq ft terrace)\LLocation:
    8th arrondissement \u2014 near Avenue des Champs-\xC9lys\xE9es & Place de la
    Concorde\LDescription: Bright penthouse with large windows, terrace overlooking
    Paris rooftops and the Eiffel Tower, interiors blending classic Parisian moldings
    with modern minimalism. Every corner invites you to savour the city\u2019s timeless
    romance.\LAmenities: 24/7 concierge, private airport transfers (limousine), daily
    breakfast served in-suite, premium minibar restocked on request.\LExtra perks:
    Complimentary Seine River evening cruise tickets for stays of 4+ nights.\LSample
    rate: from \u20AC1,200 / night"
